{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras/42d264a25e5605529471793039d9d406.avif?t=1765893470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras_big/42d264a25e5605529471793039d9d406.webp?t=1765893470 width=1560 height=504 /></span><br>Step into <strong>ALiminal</strong>, a psychological horror experience meticulously crafted to be the most detailed and visually faithful rendition of the Backrooms and the liminal space aesthetic.<br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Unmatched Realism:</strong> Experience the  humming fluorescent lights, and unsettling textures of the levels rendered with maximum visual fidelity with the power of Unreal Engine 5. Every detail is designed to maximize the feeling of uncanny emptiness and distorted familiarity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras/382cec4691f60aa363b657bbd5a624d3.avif?t=1765893470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras_big/382cec4691f60aa363b657bbd5a624d3.webp?t=1765893470 width=1560 height=879 /></span><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>The Power of Atmosphere:</strong> The environments are the central focus. Submerge yourself in desolate levels that twist familiar settings into scenes of stark, psychological terror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras/ac5d22c973ece0afd8c94f99be5976fb.avif?t=1765893470\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Uncover the Truth:</strong> What lies beyond the infinite? As you traverse the levels, piece together the subtle narrative fragments left behind to uncover the dark origin of these spaces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras/ecda6189c1619e5d6d60505af7a6b2b3.avif?t=1765893470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras_big/ecda6189c1619e5d6d60505af7a6b2b3.webp?t=1765893470 width=1560 height=881 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, I am working hard to get the game to a point where I can share it with you. I am pushing to launch <strong>ALiminal</strong> as soon as possible, and I'm excited for what's coming next!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436880?t=1765893470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/6cefbef5bb7f391269d46f92352793b32bf666a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765893470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/46e2938fa669ba1191ba5bc6db31795dce8883fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765893470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/46e2938fa669ba1191ba5bc6db31795dce8883fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765893470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras/42d264a25e5605529471793039d9d406.avif?t=1765893470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436880/extras_big/42d264a25e5605529471793039d9d406.webp?t=1765893470 width=1560 height=504 /></span><br>Step into <strong>ALiminal</strong>, a psychological horror experience meticulously crafted to be the most detailed and visually faithful rendition of the Backrooms and the liminal space aesthetic.<br><br>-\u00a